jewbuntu (0.1.0~m1.5+26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix future-dated changelog entries: packaged file mtimes come from the
    changelog date (reproducible builds), so future dates made fontconfig
    warn "mtime in the future" and could hide new fonts. A unit test now
    rejects changelog dates later than the build time.

 -- Jewbuntu Developers <maintainers@jewbuntu.invalid>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:22:00 -0500

jewbuntu (0.1.0~m1.4+26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Startup sound: keep waiting while audio is still settling at login
    (no sink yet, or a transient mute) instead of skipping; log every
    decision to the journal and ~/.local/state/jewbuntu/startup-sound.last;
    louder default (peak -6 dBFS, stream 0.8 of system volume, which is
    still never raised).
  * Settings migration also runs at every graphical login, not only when
    the user manager starts.
  * Skin/defaults tools read Ubuntu-session defaults even over SSH.

 -- Jewbuntu Developers <maintainers@jewbuntu.invalid>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:15:00 -0500

jewbuntu (0.1.0~m1.3+26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Mac-style desktop defaults: floating, translucent, rounded dock with
    dot indicators, always visible, trash at the end, no drive icons;
    Inter interface font; weekday in the clock. Defaults only - user
    choices still win; 'jewbuntu defaults restore' covers the new keys.
  * New jewbuntu-gnome: "Jewbuntu Look" extension (GNOME 50 only) with a
    translucent top bar and the clock on the right.
  * 'jewbuntu skin apply|undo|status' and a one-time first-login question
    so existing Ubuntu accounts can adopt the Jewbuntu look (including the
    Hebrew keyboard, appended to existing layouts) with a saved backup.

 -- Jewbuntu Developers <maintainers@jewbuntu.invalid>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:00:00 -0500

jewbuntu (0.1.0~m1.2+26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Settings schema 2: startup sound becomes {enabled, volume}; quiet
    schedule records its mode. Migrated per user at login by
    jewbuntu-migrate.service, with a verified backup of schema 1.
  * Startup sound honours the per-user volume (stream-relative only).

 -- Jewbuntu Developers <maintainers@jewbuntu.invalid>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:50:00 -0500

